# ==========================================================================
# 這個 repo 是「公開」的（github.com/Steven8925/st8925lab，visibility: public），
# 而且整個工作目錄同時就是 Cloudflare Pages 的發佈來源。因此任何被 commit 的
# 檔案會同時出現在兩個公開位置，且 git 歷史無法真正刪除。
#
# This repo is PUBLIC (github.com/Steven8925/st8925lab), and the working
# directory doubles as the Cloudflare Pages publish root. Anything committed
# is exposed in two public places at once, and git history cannot truly
# un-publish it.
#
# 之前沒有這個檔案 —— 也就是說一次 `git add .` 就會把下列筆記檔連同其中的
# 正式密鑰推上公開 repo。新增於 2026-08-14 覆核時。
# This file did not exist before: a single `git add .` would have pushed the
# notes files below — including a live production secret — to the public repo.
# Added during the 2026-08-14 review.
# ==========================================================================

# 部署過程的個人筆記檔，內含正式環境密鑰／示範帳密，不得進版控。
# Personal deployment scratch notes containing live secrets / demo credentials.
render installation guide.txt
手機密碼.txt

# 防禦性規則：任何 .env 都不進版控（source/.gitignore 已擋一次，這裡再擋一次）。
# Defensive: never commit any .env (source/.gitignore already covers its own).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python 暫存快取
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 暫存下載與筆記
*.digest
*.download
github_commit.txt
V4/
*新文件*.txt
$RECYCLE.BIN/
temp_ref_imgs/
.agents/

# Wrangler 本機開發暫存與本機密鑰檔（Phase 1，2026-09-23）。
# Wrangler local dev state and local secrets file (Phase 1, 2026-09-23).
.wrangler/
.dev.vars*
node_modules/

# 本機 Claude Code 工具設定（launch.json 等）：只在本機使用，不進版控。
# 注意：.assetsignore 並未排除 .claude/，而 .claude/settings.local.json 已被追蹤且
# 線上可讀（HTTP 200）；本規則只擋「之後新增」的檔案，既有追蹤需另做 git rm --cached。
# Local Claude Code tooling config (launch.json etc). Note .assetsignore does NOT
# exclude .claude/, and .claude/settings.local.json is ALREADY tracked and publicly
# readable; this rule only stops new files - untracking needs git rm --cached.
.claude/

# 缺陷登記簿（2026-09-24）：本 repo 在 GitHub 為 public。.assetsignore 只擋靜態資產
# 發佈，擋不住 GitHub（見 .assetsignore 自身的說明）。一份列出未修補弱點、且附上
# 檔案行號的登記簿放進公開 repo，等於主動把攻擊路徑交出去。故不進版控。
# Defect register: this repo is public on GitHub. .assetsignore stops asset publishing,
# not GitHub. A register of unpatched weaknesses with file:line anchors must not be
# committed to a public repository.
DEFECTS.md
PLAN_*.md
